# r36s-autoinstaller
===
 R36S Auto-Installer is a free program for Windows, Linux, and Mac that automates the installation of dArkOSen firmware on your R36S console. It guides you step-by-step: download the latest version from GitHub, prepare your SD card, and copy the correct files for your motherboard model—no need for a terminal or technical software.
